= Arcadia Branch


Arcadia is the capital of Mars and its largest city. Originally established as a central bureaucratic and logistical hub due to its advantageous location, the city expanded into the nerve center of the entire planet. Today, it serves as the permanent seat of the Martian Parliament.

The local {!<span style="color: #ED7158;"><strong>SPM</strong></span>!} branch is the largest and most influential in the party, frequently hosting delegates to train and prepare cadres from other regions. Carrying this heavy responsibility, the branch has adopted a pragmatic, centrist stance, aligning itself firmly with the party's progressive wing.

