@clear_agenda
title: Clear the Agenda
subtitle: Clear useless actions from the party agenda.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
if (Q.difficulty >= 0) {
    window.dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.currentHands['main'] = [];
} else {
    window.dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.currentHands['main.main_easy'] = [];
}
!}

We have forced the party to clear its current agenda to make room for new priorities.

@party_discipline
title: Enforce Party Discipline
subtitle: Use our section's influence to curb internal dissent across all factions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 6; progressist_dissent -= 6; reformist_dissent -= 6; romanticist_dissent -= 6

We have leveraged our position to enforce party discipline, bringing line-stepping factions back into fold.

@emergency_fundraising
title: Emergency Fundraising
subtitle: Call on our politicians to contribute larger donations this month.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; resources += 2

We have squeezed our elected representatives for extra dues, securing additional resources for party coffers.
